Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:09.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:24.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,S-Someone's here! Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.74,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}They're asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:34.25,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}That smell... It's Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.15,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Excuse me... are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:40.88,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}That's right. He was \Non a stakeout all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:43.64,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}But why is he sleeping there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.80,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}It's my usual spot, \Nso I let my guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:50.16,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}That was his l-lap...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:58.23,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}And I sat right down on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.09,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:20.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,...to kiss more!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:23.50,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Wait, am I just being greedy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.77,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Maybe people don't \Nusually do it that often?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:30.48,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}If I want to kiss him...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:33.01,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Why don't I just do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:35.54,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}No one else is here, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.54,0:01:37.59,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Which means now is my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:40.56,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}But am I allowed to just do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:44.31,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}But we're also dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:49.76,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}J-Just a little one...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:56.14,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}There!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:59.78,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}This area... around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:02.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:06.07,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um... not telling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:07.81,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You aren't?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:11.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, the others don't seem \Nto have caught on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.19,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is someone else here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:14.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Were you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.77,0:02:21.09,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,awake this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:24.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:04.42,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:07.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I made copies of \Nthe documents you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:13.15,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're in the office \Nall day today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:13.75,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:16.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm just putting together reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:21.79,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, is it that time already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:24.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You can head home if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:25.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thanks for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.56,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes... same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:36.64,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}It's been a week since he \Nbrought up living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.25,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}He hasn't even walked me home...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:43.59,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}When are we supposed to \Ndiscuss the arrangements?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:46.42,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm on tenterhooks about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:52.19,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm over here searching \Nfor properties online every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:56.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,N-No, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:59.71,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,wondered if we could \Nwalk home together today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:05.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This could take me a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:07.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you mind waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:09.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I'll gladly wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:11.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Since it'll be rather late,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:17.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,would you be interested \Nin staying over at my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.92,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}S-Staying over?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. \NI'm sorry for the long wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.27,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,STAYING OVER
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:36.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:41.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-We're going to your house, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Should we call it off after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.34,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:53.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:54.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:57.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,let's stop by a convenience store to \Nbuy dinner and things you might need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:05:58.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:06.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They have overnight sets \Nwith toner and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is there a brand you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:10.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:14.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You'll need a makeup remover \Nand a toothbrush...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:17.56,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}The shopping's getting done so fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:20.09,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}It's so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:22.50,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I don't need to call \Nover a staff member!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:23.86,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:25.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What size bottoms do you wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.03,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They have M and L.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:30.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Emm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,M, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.11,0:06:36.45,Main,Staff,0,0,0,,I'll get you rung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:38.44,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Akira-san is so smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:41.28,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,He didn't even hesitate \Nto ask about my underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:44.72,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Such an adult! Such an adult!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.26,0:06:46.10,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:51.50,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Does that mean... \Nhe's used to this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.90,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}W-We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:07.08,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Though, I've actually been here before!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:10.45,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm staying... I'm staying \Nthe night tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:13.20,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}In a man's apartment... \Nin my boyfriend's apartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:17.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Are you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:21.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You seem quite tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:24.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Since we're considering living \Ntogether in the near future,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:29.59,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I thought it would be good \Nto try a night together...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:31.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I guess I am moving too fast, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:32.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:34.22,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:39.72,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,When you live together, \Nyou spend {\i1}every night{\i0} together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:40.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What a thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:47.36,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Yet I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:52.11,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I totally jumped the gun and started \Nsearching for properties instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:55.71,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'll go home with \NAkira-san every day! Squee!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:08:00.69,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm so embarrassed! \NI got completely ahead of myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:03.34,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}She seems extraordinarily anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:07.09,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Er... should we try \Nthe sleepover another night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:12.65,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I want to try the sleepover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.56,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I don't want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:21.73,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I understand. Let's spend \Nthe night together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:26.30,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You must be hungry. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:29.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:38.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'd like to show you around my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:39.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:43.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You showed me about it \Nthe first time I came...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:45.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,There are some things \NI haven't walked you through yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:51.45,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This door is on the right as you enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.45,0:08:52.38,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This is the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.65,0:08:59.47,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You usually sleep in here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:04.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,As we walk along \Nthe right side of the bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:07.92,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,there's a lamp here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:09.22,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:14.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll take the couch tonight, \Nso I want you to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:19.66,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'll be sleeping in Akira-san's bed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:23.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Last, I'll show you to the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Feel free to make use of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:42.71,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm naked in Akira-san's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.48,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}But... what is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:53.72,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm kind of embarrassed, \Nkind of excited...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:56.49,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Kind of... delighted?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:04.62,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm acting like this \Nover my first sleepover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:06.91,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Can I really handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:16.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Are you here? I thought \NI heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:17.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:20.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sitting on the sofa. \NFeel free to sit next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:27.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:33.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Humans dry their hair, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll bring a hair dryer for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:38.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Invisible people don't have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:43.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Our hair and skin have different \Nproperties, so we don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:45.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It would actually be bad \Nfor my hair to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:47.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:54.48,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Why does he have one \Nif he doesn't use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:59.93,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}If someone stays over? Karma-san, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:03.68,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}He's used to this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:08.30,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Maybe he had a girlfriend before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:13.95,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}He's so mature and kind, of course, \Nit's natural that he would...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:16.59,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:18.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.27,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}This should make me so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:30.01,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}so why am I anxious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:36.58,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Did he dry his last\Ngirlfriend's hair like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:44.90,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Did he discuss dating with \Nthe presumption of marriage with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.15,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}No, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:49.48,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Getting in my own head \Nabout it will just depress me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:51.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Did that tickle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:54.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Hey... Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:59.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'd like to... kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:05.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:09.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It might make me want to \Nskip a few steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:11.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:16.92,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,SKIP A FEW STEPS?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:16.08,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Skip steps to what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:20.95,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:27.28,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Skip steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:29.88,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Kissing would make him \Nwant to skip steps and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:39.24,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:42.24,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,What's Karma been up to lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:43.60,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Haven't seen him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.43,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, he went back to his shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:53.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,He says he was able to vent a lot of \Nhis curses on that recent investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:55.38,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,He said he had to take a page from
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:56.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san and focus on his business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:00.80,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,You were awesome back there, Tonome-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.26,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,I gotta work hard, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:03.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:06.92,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,What's with that guy? Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:14.86,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:15.72,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:21.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What led to you and \NMadaraito-san living together?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.16,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be a question about work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:28.24,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EARNEST
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:39.50,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:42.72,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That was a very long wait \Nfor a very simple answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:45.72,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me about stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:48.21,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I guess it's like a work mindset thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:51.99,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Detective stuff means extracting \Ninfo from someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:56.14,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,so I'm guarded about revealing \Nmy personal info to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:58.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So you're embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:14:01.10,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Shut up. You can't just ask that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:05.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was just hoping to get some info \Nfor personal reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.23,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:10.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll ask Madaraito-san and—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:12.74,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Don't ask that blabbermouth anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:16.80,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,The reason we started living \Ntogether is because Daichi—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:19.88,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:23.81,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,So you guys are gonna\Nmove in together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:24.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:29.76,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think our experience \Nis gonna be any help to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:33.00,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You don't want practical \Nadvice on cohabiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:38.61,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Asking something like that means you've \Ngot something specific on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:42.14,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well, that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:45.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san is just so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.61,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Now you're just bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:47.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:53.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,He's {\i1}too{\i0} amazing. I keep thinking \NI'll end up totally dependent on him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:56.96,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You think he's too accommodating of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:59.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes! It feels like something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:01.00,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,So tell him to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:04.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Even though he's amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:07.67,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Speak up or put a stop to it, \Nand restore some balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:11.51,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Though, I can't promise it'll end \Nup in your ideal form at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:12.56,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:15.35,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,STONE-BAKED SWEET POTATOES
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.60,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Here you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:30.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. I brought you back \Na baked sweet potato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:32.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I haven't had one in so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Can we split it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:40.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:43.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.43,0:15:46.33,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}What was that "ah" about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:49.91,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I check your sweet potato?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:54.38,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I just messed up splitting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:57.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:01.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You took advantage of my blindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:03.66,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You rotten SD!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:05.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm going back to cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.99,0:16:07.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,S...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.61,0:16:10.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Kikira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:13.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What's an SD?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:14.35,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:22.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:27.03,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was acting really selfishly earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:28.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:32.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You've been evaluating me too highly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Kikira-san told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:39.30,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,SD? Look it up yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:43.31,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well... I partly want to know \Nthe definition, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:47.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was hoping I could talk about it, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:53.74,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You're both exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:58.55,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,SD is short for "super darling."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:16:59.93,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Super...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:04.17,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,In certain circles, \Nit's used to refer to a desirable,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:06.48,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,mature, perpetually smooth, perfect man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:09.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Perfect? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:14.16,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,He has an excellent education, \Nhe's tall, he has a good income.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:18.05,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,But he's also kind, from a good family, \Nattractive, and good at housework.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:23.94,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Common SDs with all those \Ntraits include wealthy heirs...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:24.29,Main - Top,Heir,0,0,0,,I'm a wealthy heir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:26.07,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,CEOs...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.44,Main - Top,CEO,0,0,0,,CEO!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:28.96,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,And oil barons...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:30.42,Main - Top,Baron,0,0,0,,I'm an oil baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:38.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:40.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,you shouldn't assume things\Njust because I'm invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:43.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So humble! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:50.92,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Am I being too accommodating with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:52.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:55.02,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,it's selfish to complain \Nabout you caring about me, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:56.51,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Forget I said anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:59.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, it takes courage \Nto be honest about these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:00.39,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.39,0:18:02.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.93,0:18:05.25,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}He's even trying \Nto reassure me... He's so kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:10.65,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But it's not because I'm an "SD" \Nor anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:14.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I want to earn your trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:18.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:22.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Hang on... You think I don't trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:25.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:27.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.15,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is there a reason it's \Nhard to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:34.13,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's just,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.62,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't want to make \Nexcuses for my behavior
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.62,0:18:38.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,when you're already feeling anxious...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:41.14,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,This is just what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:44.02,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,O-Oh, right. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:50.47,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,For a long time, invisible \Npeople mostly worked as spies
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.47,0:18:53.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and other secretive professions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:57.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,So many of us have few \Nrecords of our past,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:59.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and don't know our roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:03.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Our invisibility was considered useful,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:08.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but it's hard for us, as a race, \Nto establish trust with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:14.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,When I was young, too, \NI was tutored on how to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It was like... Tips about blending \Ninto normal society.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.25,0:19:21.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I wonder why that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:27.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The only thing that makes you different \Nis that you're invisible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:31.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Why does that make it hard \Nfor people to trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:33.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The {\i1}only thing{\i0} that makes us different?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.69,0:19:41.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I guess, from your perspective, \Nthat's not a big difference at all, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:43.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:46.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Not at all. It makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:48.49,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.99,0:19:55.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Does being invisible make life hard \Nfor most invisible people?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:58.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,A few years back,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:01.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,an invisible fashion \Nmodel appeared on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:04.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,He incorporated his \Ninvisibility into his looks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.05,0:20:05.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and became the talk of the industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:08.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It put the existence of invisible \Npeople into the spotlight
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:10.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and helped people understand us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:15.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Were invisible models really that rare?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:19.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I think he was the first \Ninvisible model ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:21.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,though he's retired now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:25.21,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Meeting him when I was a child saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:27.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You know him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:28.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:33.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,He's part of the reason I started \Nusing clothing to express myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.50,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,He's like a big brother \Nto me, and a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:41.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I didn't know you had \Nan inspiration like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:46.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll try to be a little \Nless overly accommodating with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:49.02,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And I'll start with...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:54.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Devouring this donut \Nright in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.77,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Starting there, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:04.56,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Another sleepover!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:06.74,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I was nervous at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:09.79,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,but Akira-san's been acted so normal, \NI'm really getting used to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:14.93,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}And here I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:19.88,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,hoping for even more \Ncanoodling than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:22.62,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}What do you mean, even more canoodling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:34.28,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Is it kind of a let-down?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:45.44,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}It's hard for invisible people \Nto earn trust with others...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.67,0:21:51.40,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I couldn't tell her the real reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.73,0:21:54.64,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I've got to tell her properly sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:00.64,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I really don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.05,0:22:10.05,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 8: I GUESS I'M BEING SELFISH\NTO BE CONTINUED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:04.64,Main,,0,0,0,,
